      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. THE ARCHITECTURE: everything that exists.\nOne per team: ACA job, container registry, Airflow VM, Databricks catalog,\nstorage account, repository, and the backend's Postgres (Railway, not Azure).\nShared: the SQL warehouse and Key Vault.",
