      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ARROWS: what flows\nblack    data\ngreen    orchestration\npurple   code\norange   secrets\nteal     operations\n\nBOXES: what it is\nyellow   compute, it bills\ncyan     files\nred      a table\nviolet   your code\nblue     the backend's DB\ngrey     not yours\n\ndashed   optional",
      "originalText": "ARROWS: what flows\nblack    data\ngreen    orchestration\npurple   code\norange   secrets\nteal     operations\n\nBOXES: what it is\nyellow   compute, it bills\ncyan     files\nred      a table\nviolet   your code\nblue     the backend's DB\ngrey     not yours\n\ndashed   optional",
