    {
      "id": "d2_no_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 776.2,
      "y": 1895.5,
      "width": 607.6,
      "height": 91.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1992396396,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1124798361,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refused, by permission and not by convention\nwriting the prod container, the analytics, ops and raw_app schemas,\nthe backend's analytics schema, and reading the team service principal\nor the analytics_user password out of Key Vault\none exception: a dev-run principal that starts only the dev job",
      "originalText": "Refused, by permission and not by convention\nwriting the prod container, the analytics, ops and raw_app schemas,\nthe backend's analytics schema, and reading the team service principal\nor the analytics_user password out of Key Vault\none exception: a dev-run principal that starts only the dev job",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d2_why",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2030,
      "width": 1023.0,
      "height": 78.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1676563099,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1951717206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You will hit one of these refusals in week 2, and it will look like a bug. It is not: it is the split working.\nMove the write to your own dev schema, or promote it to the schedule, which is the next diagram.\nYou share analytics_dev with your teammates, so the last publish wins. The table carries a comment\nnaming the schema its rows came from, which is how you tell whose run you are looking at.",
      "originalText": "You will hit one of these refusals in week 2, and it will look like a bug. It is not: it is the split working.\nMove the write to your own dev schema, or promote it to the schedule, which is the next diagram.\nYou share analytics_dev with your teammates, so the last publish wins. The table carries a comment\nnaming the schema its rows came from, which is how you tell whose run you are looking at.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d3_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 833.28,
      "height": 36.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1898556446,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1740359626,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Promoting it: the same code, run by a machine",
      "originalText": "3. Promoting it: the same code, run by a machine",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d3_sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2198,
      "width": 1091.2,
      "height": 41.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 535569032,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 713264691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your code does not change when it moves here. What changes is who runs it and what that identity is\nallowed to touch, which is why something that worked on your laptop can still fail on the first scheduled run.",
      "originalText": "Your code does not change when it moves here. What changes is who runs it and what that identity is\nallowed to touch, which is why something that worked on your laptop can still fail on the first scheduled run.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
