    {
      "id": "d3_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2450,
      "width": 976.5,
      "height": 58.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1636477929,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1515291969,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Four of the five prove who they are without a password: Azure hands the identity to the machine at\nrun time, so there is nothing to leak and nothing to rotate. The fifth is a real Postgres password, so it\nlives in Key Vault and the Airflow VM's identity is the only thing permitted to read it.",
      "originalText": "Four of the five prove who they are without a password: Azure hands the identity to the machine at\nrun time, so there is nothing to leak and nothing to rotate. The fifth is a real Postgres password, so it\nlives in Key Vault and the Airflow VM's identity is the only thing permitted to read it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d3_swap",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2550,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1471414917,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1624356422,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d3_swap_t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 167.34,
      "y": 2575.4,
      "width": 425.32,
      "height": 109.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1411553456,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1436095807,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What the promotion actually swaps\nAirflow in Docker becomes the team's Airflow VM\nthe dev container becomes the prod container\ndev_<yourname> becomes analytics, ops and raw_app\nanalytics_dev becomes analytics, same table name\ndata/.env becomes Airflow Variables and Key Vault",
      "originalText": "What the promotion actually swaps\nAirflow in Docker becomes the team's Airflow VM\nthe dev container becomes the prod container\ndev_<yourname> becomes analytics, ops and raw_app\nanalytics_dev becomes analytics, same table name\ndata/.env becomes Airflow Variables and Key Vault",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "d3_swap_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 2560,
      "width": 641.7,
      "height": 117.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 414284292,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 565750857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nothing on the left of that list is missing from the right. It is the\nsame DAG file and the same models, run by something that does not\nneed you awake, against the resources you were refused on purpose.\nIf your laptop could write the right-hand column instead, a half-\nfinished Tuesday experiment would land in the table the backend\nserves, indistinguishable from the run that failed at 03:00.",
      "originalText": "Nothing on the left of that list is missing from the right. It is the\nsame DAG file and the same models, run by something that does not\nneed you awake, against the resources you were refused on purpose.\nIf your laptop could write the right-hand column instead, a half-\nfinished Tuesday experiment would land in the table the backend\nserves, indistinguishable from the run that failed at 03:00.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
